br&gt;key includes KB snapshot" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=12;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1" ><mxGeometry x="1640" y="210" width="200" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c32" value="cache" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;dashed=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c30" target="c31"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c33" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c26" target="c30"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c34" value="Two Redis instances — never mix secrets with caches" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fad9d5;strokeColor=#ae4132;dashed=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;opacity=60;" vertex="1" parent="1" ><mxGeometry x="30" y="400" width="1840" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c35" value="&lt;b&gt;Redis-sec&lt;/b&gt;: tokens · OTP · BFF sessions&lt;br&gt;app-level AES-GCM (KMS / Vault keys) · TLS · per-service ACL&lt;br&gt;no RDB/AOF · no backups · KEYS / MONITOR / CONFIG / FLUSHALL disabled&lt;br&gt;eviction → fail closed (re-authenticate)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fad9d5;strokeColor=#ae4132;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1" ><mxGeometry x="70" y="445" width="860" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c36" value="&lt;b&gt;Redis-cache&lt;/b&gt;: embeddings · retrieval · FAQ · account summary · rate limits&lt;br&gt;rebuildable · allkeys-lru · keys always scoped by customer_id&lt;br&gt;where the data is personal" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1" ><mxGeometry x="980" y="445" width="850" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c37" value="&lt;b&gt;Never cached&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;write-tool results · entitlements / permissions (or ≤ 60 s) · semantic cache of personalised answers · checkpoints (Postgres is the source of truth)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fad9d5;strokeColor=#ae4132;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1" ><mxGeometry x="30" y="620" width="1100" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c38" value="&lt;b&gt;Invalidation = version in the key&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;KB snapshot, embedding model, release label.&lt;br&gt;A new release changes the key; no manual purges.&lt;br&gt;The only explicit purge: write tools → account summary." style="shape=note;size=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1" ><mxGeometry x="1180" y="610" width="690" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>